  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.91,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.89,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Commercial MediationCentre of Sri Lanka (Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.61,
      401.88,
      383.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Commercial Mediation Centre ofSri Lanka Act, No. 44 of 2000 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      398.57,
      305.14,
      409.91
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (1) thereof,\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      201.57,
      424.61,
      401.86,
      474.95
    ],
    "text": "(a)by the repeal of all the words and figure from\u201c(1) The administration and Management\u201d tothe words \u201cappointed by the Minister:\u2013\u201d andthe substitution therefor of the following:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      221.85,
      489.53,
      401.87,
      552.95
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) The administration and Managementof the affairs of the Centre shall be vested in aBoard of Management (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cBoard\u201d) which shall consist of thefollowing members:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      227.85,
      567.53,
      401.74,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "(i)the following ex-officio members,namely\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      249.57,
      606.53,
      401.87,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "(a)the Secretary to the Ministry ofthe Minister assigned the subjectof Justice or his nominee abovethe rank of Senior AssistantSecretary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
